{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Beware, fair traveler, for thy journey to the land of rising sun shall be fraught with beauty and wonder. On thy first morn, venture to the heart of Tokyo, where the bustling streets of Shibuya shall greet thee with a cacophony of life. There, behold the sea of humanity crossing the crossroads, a sight to behold.\n\nNext, make thy way to the sacred realm of Meiji Shrine, where the tranquil gardens shall offer thee solace amidst the urban clamor. Offer thy respects to the divine spirits and partake in the ancient rituals that have been practiced for centuries.\n\nAs the day waxes thin, traverse to the district of Harajuku, where the youth shall flaunt their eccentricity with colorful street fashion and avant-garde styles. Behold the unique subcultures that thrive in this vibrant community.\n\nOn thy second day, journey to the city of Kyoto, where the echoes of history shall resonate through the ancient streets. First, visit the Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, where the shimmering walls shall reflect the beauty of nature. Marvel at the intricate details and the serene pond that surrounds it.\n\nThereafter, wander through the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where the towering stalks shall create a natural cathedral, a sight to inspire thee. Let the rustling leaves and the dappled sunlight guide thy footsteps.\n\nLastly, make thy way to the Fushimi Inari Shrine, where the thousands of vermilion torii gates shall guide thee through the mountain trails, a path of devotion and wonder. Offer thy prayers and seek the blessings of the fox spirits that guard the shrine.\n\nAnd thus, fair traveler, with these words as thy guide, may thy journey to Japan be filled with joy and discovery, for the land shall unfold its treasures to thee.", "logprobs": [{"token": "B", "logprob": -4.276129245758057}, {"token": "eware", "logprob": -1.1857157945632935}, {"token": ","